# Frontend build inputs. Copying these into the Python image would add hundreds
# of MB and bust the Tectonic prewarm layer on every CSS change. The image has
# no Node stage yet, so it currently ships no frontend at all — when one is
# added it must run `npm ci && npm run build` itself rather than expect these.
# See README, "The frontend is not in the image yet".
node_modules
.next
frontend/node_modules
frontend/.next
frontend/out
